{"unit_id":"HongzhongL__dsh-grayprint#feature-1","repo":"HongzhongL/dsh-grayprint","commit":"1bf13a8a108829cce2decac8af4221eb0356e6ca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GrayPrint 的功能「推理风格指纹」：汇总当前会话 reasoning block 内各段首的第一人称与 I'm/ I'll 写法，计算相对参考样本的风格得分。样本、语言或信号不足时会显示相应提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:218","lib/client.js:325","lib/client.js:359"]}
{"unit_id":"HongzhongL__dsh-grayprint#feature-2","repo":"HongzhongL/dsh-grayprint","commit":"1bf13a8a108829cce2decac8af4221eb0356e6ca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GrayPrint 的功能「段首组织倾向」：独立统计内部段落以 Let me 或 We need 开头的数量，并展示两类写法的相对倾向；命中段落少于门槛时暂不提供进度。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:325","lib/client.js:359"]}
{"unit_id":"HongzhongL__dsh-grayprint#feature-3","repo":"HongzhongL/dsh-grayprint","commit":"1bf13a8a108829cce2decac8af4221eb0356e6ca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GrayPrint 的功能「实时会话面板」：订阅当前会话更新并刷新统计，在 DSH 网页 shell.overlay 中显示可展开的面板；会话订阅和统计 store 绑定插件生命周期清理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:390","lib/client.js:426","lib/client.js:917"]}
